00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:23,320
 What ligament is most likely involved with this finding?

145
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:30,920
 Go ahead pause the video and then we'll go over this together.

146
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:36,080
 So again it's always good practice to read the question first then read through or at

147
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:41,720
 least skim the entire patient box and then go through the answer choices.

148
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:48,800
 Now in this case though there's a whole lot of information in this box about condler injury,

