00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:12,320
 occasion it's just extraneous information that might try to even throw you off.

154
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:16,400
 So just keep that in mind when you're reading through these.

155
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:22,320
 The normal protrusive movement for an adult or even an adolescent patient would be somewhere

156
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:25,160
 between five and twelve millimeters.

157
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:29,480
 So this 10 millimeter finding is well within normal limits.

158
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:32,120
 There's nothing pathologic going on here.

